                  <xs:element maxOccurs="1" minOccurs="0" name="exportContribution4">
                    <xs:simpleType>
                      <xs:annotation>
                        <xs:documentation>The user may specify the 'exportContribution4' (boolean) switch. If &quot;true&quot; is selected, then contribution 4 (due to motion times pressure gradient) of the drift forces is exported. If false is selected, then contribution 4 is not exported. (default value = true)</xs:documentation>
