                        <xs:documentation>The user may specify the 'exportContribution5' (boolean) switch. If &quot;true&quot; is selected, then contribution 5 (due to 2nd order wave, or setdown) of the drift forces is exported. If false is selected, then contribution 5 is not exported. (default value = true)</xs:documentation>
