                      <xs:annotation>
                        <xs:documentation>The user may specify the 'waveDirInteraction' (boolean) switch. If &quot;true&quot; is selected, then the wave drift forces due to interaction between wave directions will be computed. If &quot;false&quot; they are not computed. Make sure to specify 'numberOfWavedirectionDiagonals' as well (default value = false)</xs:documentation>
