                    <xs:simpleType>
                      <xs:annotation>
                        <xs:documentation>The user may specify the 'FaltinsenMichelsen' (boolean) switch. If &quot;true&quot; is selected, then (in addition to direct pressure integration) the mean wave drift forces will also be computed with the method of FaltinsenMichelsen. If &quot;false&quot; is selected they are not computed. (default value = false)</xs:documentation>
