                    <xs:simpleType>
                      <xs:annotation>
                        <xs:documentation>The user may specify the 'phaseWrtGlobalOrigin' (boolean) switch. If &quot;true&quot; is selected, then the phase of the QTF for each body is calculated with respect to the wave in the global origin. If false is selected the phase is with respect to the CoG of each body. (default value = false)</xs:documentation>
